tem/uploads/fae/image/asset/2128/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hello_Heart.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2128/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hello_Heart.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2128/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hello_Heart.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2128/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hello_Heart.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2128/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hello_Heart.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2128/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hello_Heart.jpg","We all know that a healthy heart is central to overall good health, yet heart disease remains a leading cause of death in the U.S., claiming millions of lives each year. Hello Heart is on a mission to change that.  As an AI company focused exclusively on heart health, Hello Heart has built a platform that predicts and prevents cardiac events before they happen, identifying risk earlier and more precisely than traditional clinical models. From the company's earliest days, Maayan Cohen and the team embedded AI at the core of the platform. As the cardiac prevention partner to a majority of large U.S. health plans and hundreds of public and private employers, Hello Heart is reducing both the rate of chronic heart conditions and the overall cost of care. It's rare to be able to invest in a company providing such a vital and virtuous service.","Digital coaching app Hello Heart is empowering users to live happy, healthy lives by helping them participate actively in their own heart health journeys. ","Hello Heart - IVP Portfolio - Digital Health & Tech Venture Capital","Hello Heart - IVP Portfolio  ","An AI company on a mission to make heart attacks a thing of the past",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"319","2021-01-01","https: